      "value": "To followup, I have found multiple errors like this.\n\n- L Collar Element 2 Weight\n\n- L Arm Element 2 Weight\n\n- R Arm Element 2 Weight\n\n- R Collar Element 2 Weight\n\nThere's likely more, but it's difficult to track these down.\n\nIn all of these situations, I have a parent constraint with the \"Freeze Position Axes\" unchecked and there is a position constraint on the same object.",
